{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西貢沙角尾村發生停電事故。立法會議員方國珊今日（22日）晚上9時許在Facebook表示，西貢沙角尾村多間村屋停電，多戶居民大受影響，中電接報後到場搶修，正安排臨時供電。</p><p>圖中可見，工程人員正準備臨時電纜，為居民供電，居民在場視察。</p><p>《香港01》到場了解，現場消息稱，上址地底其中一條電纜故障肇禍。</p><figure><img alt=\"西貢沙角尾村多間村屋停電。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190089701512450048932487.jpeg/_37MUYDQlZf-lMf_4QBJGNm6Db0HE_gZe6lb1UGpW9U\"/><figcaption>西貢沙角尾村多間村屋停電。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西貢沙角尾村多間村屋停電。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190089695032381440276134.jpeg/oNo7wJofQioXdMW1JQjrq2ByrARiSMUI5mpqtNxqarQ\"/><figcaption>西貢沙角尾村多間村屋停電。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工程人員到場。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190089692259815424032649.jpeg/OnTNuwnSYSws3WGSBGsBGj0v9Ro6eR6YWYPcp2OD3Kc\"/><figcaption>工程人員到場。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工程人員到場。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190089714133635072849513.jpeg/uJat8UWIYQ-d43V3EvybRTXaBqnlKtX4XUb6FGdG-hQ\"/><figcaption>工程人員到場。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工程人員正準備臨時電纜，為居民供電。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190089710824198144823574.jpeg/ZhWhna4SVCbXSsh0znZleNTuaFyTYGfPtp6VvIyelbw\"/><figcaption>工程人員正準備臨時電纜，為居民供電。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工程人員正準備臨時電纜，為居民供電。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190089707502178304365491.jpeg/YUAfHZLPtyzn8CQs9RUKgSwjYohaRtXz8s__2cjP_9k\"/><figcaption>工程人員正準備臨時電纜，為居民供電。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工程人員正準備臨時電纜，為居民供電。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190089704222101504725610.jpeg/IJFP3wbeyu4jgXh9RdOvXCJKKUQDGP-TtFKaxI5SmsQ\"/><figcaption>工程人員正準備臨時電纜，為居民供電。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工程人員正準備臨時電纜，為居民供電，居民在場視察。（方國珊Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190080921601052672306728.jpeg/531WsmoWs8qWgQC-IImQAPN7g7nxian9ItyhFSLcoRU\"/><figcaption>工程人員正準備臨時電纜，為居民供電，居民在場視察。（方國珊Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工程人員正準備臨時電纜，為居民供電。（方國珊Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190080924298121216734862.jpeg/9JVpXqvh7soGKPOWqZjx4NP3HIfSRVUGmR-orZkfqK0\"/><figcaption>工程人員正準備臨時電纜，為居民供電。（方國珊Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:37.203449+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":367,"images":9,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:25:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:18:12.766986+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:18:12.766986+00:00","content_hash":"370ff81dece558e556530f40f66995695185955384bf2c97bf4c20633f167814","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}